Terminals unused in grammar

    COMMENTLINE
    CMD_OPTION


Grammar

    0 $accept: spice $end

    1 spice: netlist end

    2 end: end EOL
    3    | END

    4 netlist: netlist line
    5        | line

    6 line: component EOL
    7     | command EOL
    8     | EOL
    9     | error EOL

   10 component: resistor
   11          | capacitor
   12          | inductor
   13          | vccs
   14          | vs
   15          | vcvs
   16          | cs
   17          | cccs
   18          | ccvs
   19          | diode

   20 command: print
   21        | dc
   22        | ac
   23        | tran
   24        | op
   25        | plot

   26 resistor: RESISTOR node node value

   27 capacitor: CAPACITOR node node value

   28 inductor: INDUCTOR node node value

   29 vccs: VCCS node node node node value

   30 vs: VS node node
   31   | VS node node value
   32   | vs RK_DC value
   33   | vs RK_AC value
   34   | vs RK_PULSE LBRACKET value value value value value value value RBRACKET
   35   | vs RK_SIN LBRACKET value value value value value RBRACKET

   36 vcvs: VCVS node node node node value

   37 cs: CS node node
   38   | CS node node value
   39   | cs RK_DC value
   40   | cs RK_AC value
   41   | cs RK_PULSE LBRACKET value value value value value value value RBRACKET
   42   | cs RK_SIN LBRACKET value value value value value RBRACKET

   43 cccs: CCCS node node VS value

   44 ccvs: CCVS node node VS value

   45 diode: DIODE node node modelName

   46 op: CMD_OP

   47 dc: CMD_DC
   48   | dc VS value value value
   49   | dc CS value value value

   50 ac: CMD_AC RK_DEC value value value
   51   | CMD_AC RK_LIN value value value
   52   | CMD_AC RK_OCT value value value

   53 tran: CMD_TRAN value
   54     | CMD_TRAN value value
   55     | CMD_TRAN value value value

   56 print: CMD_PRINT RK_AC
   57      | CMD_PRINT RK_DC
   58      | CMD_PRINT RK_OP
   59      | CMD_PRINT RK_TRAN
   60      | print VAR_V
   61      | print VAR_I

   62 plot: CMD_PLOT RK_AC
   63     | CMD_PLOT RK_DC
   64     | CMD_PLOT RK_OP
   65     | CMD_PLOT RK_TRAN
   66     | plot VAR_V
   67     | plot VAR_I

   68 modelName: node

   69 node: STRING
   70     | INTEGER
   71     | RESISTOR
   72     | CAPACITOR
   73     | INDUCTOR
   74     | VS
   75     | VCCS
   76     | VCVS
   77     | CS
   78     | CCCS
   79     | CCVS
   80     | DIODE

   81 value: VALUE
   82      | FLOAT
   83      | INTEGER


